Path 6: START | START --> CONDITION | if-else head --> STATEMENT | (root == NULL) --> MERGE | if-else merge --> CONDITION | if-else head --> STATEMENT | (key < root->key) --> STATEMENT | (key > root->key) --> CONDITION | if-else head --> STATEMENT | (root->left == NULL) --> STATEMENT | (root->right == NULL) --> MERGE | if-else merge --> STATEMENT | struct node* temp = minValueNode(root->right); --> STATEMENT | root->key = temp->key; --> STATEMENT | root->right = deleteNode(root->right, temp->key); --> MERGE | if-else merge --> RETURN | return root;

